/p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Supply &amp; Demand</strong>: Buy and sell goods between locales to make plenty of profit!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grow Your Caravan</strong>: Improve and expand your store with the power of coin!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect Magical Items</strong>: Fill your shelves with unique and powerful treasures.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Befriend Lifelong Customers</strong>: Happy patrons spread the word - happier ones come back for more!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore, Gather, Profit</strong>: Search the map for in-demand materials and merchandise!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Good Soup</strong>: Make your perpetual stew a community staple!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Entertain Guests</strong>: Impress your customers with music, decor, and more!   </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Recruit Marvels</strong>:  Discover mystical, mechanical employees from around the world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build a Reputation</strong>: Make a name for yourself across the major regions to become world-renowned.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Personal Style</strong>: With player customization, become the fashionable business owner you were destined to be!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Beautiful Boutique</strong>: Furnishings and layout matter - plan your store and reap the benefits of a quality establishment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Local Events</strong>: Bandits, blizzards, bountiful harvests... a community could always use some good business!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Quests and Questions</strong>: Look out for special opportunities! Results may vary. </p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://sha